      "statement": "SEC Order IA-7104, effective 2026-06-29, adjusts the Rule 205-3 qualified-client tests to at least $1,400,000 under management immediately after entering the advisory contract or a reasonable pre-contract belief that net worth exceeds $2,700,000.",
