    {
      "id": "claim_c7e4341266ef488dbaf7f5ac19775282",
      "statement": "The Private Markets Client Eligibility Determination Guide implements SEC Order IA-7104 Q.2 by requiring a qualified-client determination under either order test on or after its effective date and directing personnel to the order rather than restating its adjustable thresholds.",
