      "statement": "A pre-2026-06-29 qualified-client determination remains effective for the advisory contract or private-fund investment entered into before that date, but cannot support a new contract, subscription, or investment on or after it; the eligibility guide implements this by requiring prior-threshold identification and retesting a new subscription at adjusted amounts.",
